# Third-party 3D models: fetch your own copy, see assets/models/README.md.
# The .obj/.mtl files this project generates ARE committed (tools/export_models.py),
# so ignore downloads (which arrive in their own subfolders) but keep our exports.
assets/models/**/
!assets/models/README.md
!assets/models/*.obj
!assets/models/*.mtl

